<title>JAPAN: Nippon Elec Glass -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Elec Glass -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		121.14		vs	  117.07</p>
<p> Operating	    6.73		vs	    7.86</p>
<p> Current		6.83		vs	    5.06</p>
<p> Net		    4.89		vs	    2.54</p>
<p> EPS		   30.59 yen	  vs	   15.92 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    160 million	  vs	 160 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Electric Glass Co Ltd is a large producer of cathode-ray tube glass.</p>
</text>
